TITLE="A Five-Dimensional Orthogonal State Space of Human Mentation"

DESCRIPTION="Academic research poster proposing the Five-Dimensional Orthogonal Mentation Manifold (5DOMM): a mathematical state-space framework for modeling human mentation, Mentative Identity, cognitive development, trajectory geometry, and the open question of whether five orthogonal dimensions are sufficient for a mathematical theory of self."

